    {
      "s": 97.68,
      "e": 100.14,
      "text": "After Smell of Campground, I was like, okay, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "s": 100.14,
      "e": 102.22,
      "text": "And I could see the black smoke on this side."
    },
    {
      "s": 102.22,
      "e": 104.62,
      "text": "We were coming from eating dinner."
    },
    {
      "s": 106.54,
      "e": 110.26,
      "text": "And I guess the first thing that we realized was we just smelled smoke."
    },
    {
      "s": 110.26,
      "e": 111.62,
      "text": "So we were walking over here."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.78,
      "e": 115.78,
      "text": "And then we kind of like looked over to the right while we were walking by."
    },
    {
      "s": 115.78,
      "e": 117.3,
      "text": "I just kind of stopped because we stopped."
    },
    {
      "s": 117.3,
      "e": 118.9,
      "text": "Smell coming out of the buildings."
    },
    {
      "s": 118.9,
      "e": 123.5,
      "text": "We saw somebody kind of dangling or trying to shimmy out the window."
    },
    {
      "s": 123.5,
      "e": 124.86,
      "text": "She was at the window in the bay."
    },
    {
      "s": 125.86,
      "e": 129.86,
      "text": "And then everybody started getting blankets from this shop here."
    },
    {
      "s": 129.86,
      "e": 131.52,
      "text": "We ran in the blankets store."
    },
    {
      "s": 131.52,
      "e": 132.52,
      "text": "We grabbed blankets."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.52,
      "e": 135.52,
      "text": "Through blankets on the ground, we had the blanket in our hands."
    },
    {
      "s": 135.52,
      "e": 138.62,
      "text": "And the lady just started dropping her babies down."
    },
    {
      "s": 138.62,
      "e": 141.58,
      "text": "I mean, first she could tell she was scared."
    },
    {
      "s": 141.58,
      "e": 142.58,
      "text": "She wouldn't want to."
    },
    {
      "s": 142.58,
      "e": 148.22,
      "text": "But I'm just glad we were there to be able to help because I don't know."
    },
    {
      "s": 148.22,
      "e": 149.22,
      "text": "That's a far jump."
    },
    {
      "s": 149.22,
      "e": 151.22,
      "text": "I don't know what else the lady would have done."
    },
    {
      "s": 154.86,
      "e": 156.86,
      "text": "But now I will explain my thanks."
    },
    {
      "s": 156.86,
      "e": 161.86,
      "text": "Because I was so surprised to see people come here to the scheme of my speciality military."
    },
    {
      "s": 161.86,
      "e": 166.86,
      "text": "And the windows are now also I've been trying to see if I can see them one by one."
    },
    {
      "s": 166.86,
      "e": 167.86,
      "text": "And to see if they can do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 167.86,
      "e": 171.86,
      "text": "Just if anything, I just thank God that we were all here personally."
    },
    {
      "s": 171.86,
      "e": 175.86,
      "text": "We were here to make sure everything was okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 175.86,
      "e": 178.86,
      "text": "And here in the sound, I turned back around to look."
    },
    {
      "s": 178.86,
      "e": 181.86,
      "text": "And there was another female with the children in the window."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.86,
      "e": 186.62,
      "text": "And that's when I just, me a father of five, kind of just was like, oh no, this is not going"
    },
    {
      "s": 186.62,
      "e": 187.62,
      "text": "to happen."
    },
    {
      "s": 187.62,
      "e": 188.62,
      "text": "This is not going to happen."
    },
    {
      "s": 188.62,
      "e": 189.62,
      "text": "There's nothing to it."
    },
    {
      "s": 189.62,
      "e": 191.86,
      "text": "I mean, I'm not trying to be a hero."
    },
    {
      "s": 191.86,
      "e": 192.86,
      "text": "You're just here."
    },
    {
      "s": 192.86,
      "e": 193.86,
      "text": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "s": 193.86,
      "e": 194.86,
      "text": "Totally."
    },
    {
      "s": 194.86,
      "e": 196.86,
      "text": "That really happened, yeah, I did."
    },
    {
      "s": 196.86,
      "e": 199.86,
      "text": "Because every time I walk by, I see all this."
    },
    {
      "s": 199.86,
      "e": 204.86,
      "text": "It's like, yeah, that's all I could say."
    },
    {
      "s": 204.86,
      "e": 205.86,
      "text": "That just happened."
    },
    {
      "s": 205.86,
      "e": 207.86,
      "text": "I don't think there's so much training."
    },
    {
      "s": 207.86,
      "e": 210.86,
      "text": "There's a more like instinct type deal."
    },
    {
      "s": 210.86,
      "e": 211.86,
      "text": "You know, people aren't eating."
    },
    {
      "s": 211.86,
      "e": 212.86,
      "text": "You're either going to run."
    },
    {
      "s": 212.86,
